{{Quote|The continued and inexplicable Ghorman resistance to Imperial norms. Terrorism strikes again in Ghorman. Just three weeks after events in Corei and Jel-Novi, there was a firebombing last night at the Naval Terminal in Palmo. You can see, behind me, vapor and thermal smoke still rising from the site...|A [[Unidentified reporter 1|reporter]]|audio=AfterEventsInCoreiAndJelNovi-Messenger.flac|<ref name="Messenger" />}}
The '''Imperial Naval Terminal''' was a [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] Naval Terminal located in [[Palmo]], the [[capital|capital city]] of [[Ghorman]]<ref name="Messenger" /> In [[2 BBY]],<ref name="207Date">{{AndorDate|207}}</ref> it was the subject of a [[Firebombing at the Imperial Naval Terminal|firebombing]]. Following the incident, [[Imperial Navy]] [[admiral]] [[Tyzen]] was expected to give an update on the situation.<ref name="Messenger" /> 

